{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "mini-ecommerce-collection",
    "name": "Mini E-Commerce API",
    "description": "Postman collection lengkap untuk Mini E-Commerce Backend (NestJS + Better Auth).\n\n## Setup\n1. Set variable `baseUrl` sesuai environment (default: `http://localhost:3000`)\n2. Jalankan **Sign In** untuk mendapatkan session token\n3. Token otomatis tersimpan di variable `authToken` via test script\n\n## Auth Roles\n- **Admin Only** `🔒 ADMIN` — endpoint yang menggunakan `@Roles([UserRole.ADMIN])`\n- **Allow Anonymous** `🔓 PUBLIC` — endpoint yang menggunakan `@AllowAnonymous()`\n- **Authenticated** `🔑 AUTH` — endpoint yang memerlukan login (tanpa role spesifik)\n\n## Better Auth Endpoints\nBetter Auth meng-expose endpoint di `/api/auth/*` secara otomatis.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL server. Ubah sesuai environment (dev/staging/prod)."
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Bearer token hasil login. Otomatis di-set oleh test script Sign In / Sign Up."
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "cuid_user_id_here",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID user yang digunakan pada endpoint update user."
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "cuid_product_id_here",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID produk (CUID) yang digunakan pada endpoint update dan delete produk."
    },
    {
      "key": "categoryId",
      "value": "cuid_category_id_here",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID kategori (CUID) untuk endpoint category dan filter produk by category."
    },
    {
      "key": "productSlug",
      "value": "nama-produk-slug",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Slug produk yang digunakan pada endpoint get product by slug."
    },
    {
      "key": "categorySlug",
      "value": "nama-kategori-slug",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Slug kategori yang digunakan pada endpoint get category by slug."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth (Better Auth)",
      "description": "Endpoint autentikasi yang di-expose oleh Better Auth di `/api/auth/*`.\n\nGunakan **Sign Up** untuk membuat akun baru, lalu **Sign In** untuk mendapatkan token.\n\nToken otomatis tersimpan ke variable `authToken` via test script.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign Up (Register)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ authToken saved:', json.token);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ userId saved:', json.user.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123456\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-up", "email"]
            },
            "description": "**[POST] /api/auth/sign-up/email** 🔓 PUBLIC\n\nMendaftarkan akun baru menggunakan email dan password (Better Auth - emailAndPassword strategy).\n\nTest script otomatis menyimpan `token` ke variable `authToken` dan `userId`.\n\n**Required fields:**\n- `name` (string) - Nama user\n- `email` (string) - Email address\n- `password` (string) - Password (min 8 karakter recommended)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Sign Up - Success 200",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123456\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-up", "email"]}
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"bearer_token_string_here\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"cuid_user_id\",\n    \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"emailVerified\": false,\n    \"image\": null,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Sign Up - Email Already Exists 422",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123456\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-up/email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-up", "email"]}
              },
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"USER_ALREADY_EXISTS\",\n  \"message\": \"User already exists\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign In",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ authToken saved:', json.token);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ userId saved:', json.user.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123456\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-in", "email"]
            },
            "description": "**[POST] /api/auth/sign-in/email** 🔓 PUBLIC\n\nLogin menggunakan email dan password (Better Auth - emailAndPassword strategy).\n\nTest script otomatis menyimpan `token` ke variable `authToken` dan `userId`.\n\n**Required fields:**\n- `email` (string) - Email address\n- `password` (string) - Password"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Sign In - Success 200",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123456\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-in", "email"]}
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"bearer_token_string_here\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"cuid_user_id\",\n    \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"emailVerified\": false,\n    \"image\": null,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Sign In - Invalid Credentials 401",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpassword\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-in", "email"]}
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_EMAIL_OR_PASSWORD\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid email or password\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign Out",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}", "type": "text", "description": "Required - Bearer token dari Sign In"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-out",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-out"]
            },
            "description": "**[POST] /api/auth/sign-out** 🔑 AUTH\n\nLogout dan invalidasi session token aktif.\n\n**Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <token>`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Sign Out - Success 200",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-out", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "sign-out"]}
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}", "type": "text", "description": "Required - Bearer token dari Sign In"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "get-session"]
            },
            "description": "**[GET] /api/auth/get-session** 🔑 AUTH\n\nMendapatkan informasi session user yang sedang aktif.\n\n**Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <token>`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Get Session - Success 200",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"}],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "get-session"]}
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"session\": {\n    \"id\": \"session_id\",\n    \"expiresAt\": \"2026-09-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"token\": \"bearer_token_string_here\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"ipAddress\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n    \"userAgent\": \"PostmanRuntime/7.x\",\n    \"userId\": \"cuid_user_id\"\n  },\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"cuid_user_id\",\n    \"name\": \"Admin User\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n    \"emailVerified\": false,\n    \"image\": null,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Get Session - Unauthorized 401",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-session", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "get-session"]}
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"statusCode\": 401\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 User",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk manajemen user (`/user`).\n\n> **🔒 ADMIN** — Semua endpoint di folder ini memerlukan role `ADMIN`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Update User 🔒 ADMIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"},
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}", "type": "text", "description": "Required - Token admin (role: ADMIN)"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated User Name\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/avatar/user.jpg\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/{{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "user", "{{userId}}"]
            },
            "description": "**[PATCH] /user/:id** 🔒 ADMIN\n\nUpdate data user berdasarkan ID. Hanya dapat diakses oleh role ADMIN.\n\nSemua field bersifat **optional** (partial update):\n- `name` (string, min 3 chars) - Nama user\n- `image` (string, URL) - URL foto profil user\n\n**Path Param:** `id` - CUID user yang akan diupdate\n\n**Header:** `Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Update User - Success 200",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
                  {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"}
                ],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated User Name\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/avatar/user.jpg\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "user", "{{userId}}"]}
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"cuid_user_id\",\n  \"name\": \"Updated User Name\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"image\": \"https://example.com/avatar/user.jpg\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-20T09:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Update User - Forbidden 403",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
                  {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}"}
                ],
                "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated User Name\"\n}"},
                "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/{{userId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "user", "{{userId}}"]}
              },
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Forbidden resource\",\n  \"error\": \"Forbidden\",\n  \"statusCode\": 403\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🗂️ Category",
